WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.201
You are standing at the North Pole,
on the longest night of the year.

00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:07.043
Every way you can face from here is
south.

00:00:07.493 --> 00:00:12.229
The Sun set here in late September,
and it will not rise again until

00:00:12.229 --> 00:00:12.647
March.
